comment: Rationale for assigning this type to reference data: Mapping of this cell set to a cerebellar granule cell is supported by spatial location in the granule cell layer of the cerebellum Location is inferred from registration of MerFish Data. Registration may be inaccurate, giving misleading location to adjacent anatomical regions.
