id: CL:4301206
name: CUN-PPN Evx2 Meis2 Glut_1 glutamatergic neuron (Mmus)
def: "A glutamatergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Bnc2 (Mmus), Pax5 (Mmus), Cpne4 (Mmus), Trhr (Mmus), C1ql4 (Mmus). Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Supertype:0776 CUN-PPN Evx2 Meis2 Glut_1." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06808-9, https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
