id: CL:4301250
name: PAG-ND-PCG Onecut1 Gaba_3 GABAergic neuron (Mmus)
def: "A GABAergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Sall3 (Mmus), Gata3 (Mmus), Fign (Mmus). Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Supertype:0820 PAG-ND-PCG Onecut1 Gaba_3." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
comment: Location is inferred from registration of MerFish Data. Registration may be inaccurate, giving misleading location to adjacent anatomical regions. Warning: Despite its name, PAG-ND-PCG Onecut1 Gaba_3 does not have cells in periaqueductal gray (PAG), nucleus of darkschewitsch (ND). This assertion is based on data from registration to a reference standard common co-ordinate framework and parcelation scheme.
