def: "A GABAergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of E330013P04Rik (Mmus), Sox6 (Mmus), Tfap2b (Mmus). It is distinguished from other SC-PAG Lef1 Emx2 Gaba_3 cells by expression of Sox6. It is GABAergic (inferred from expression of Gad2, Gad1, Slc32a1). These cells are located in the Midbrain , in or close to the regions: Superior colliculus, motor related, intermediate gray layer, Superior colliculus, motor related, intermediate white layer, Superior colliculus, motor related, deep gray layer . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:3692 SC-PAG Lef1 Emx2 Gaba_3." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
