id: CL:4306347
name: NTS Dbh Glut_1 Lpl neuron (Mmus)
def: "A neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Slc6a2 (Mmus), Casr (Mmus), Lrat (Mmus). It is distinguished from other NTS Dbh Glut_1 cells by expression of Lpl. It is noradrenergic (inferred from expression of Slc6a2, Ddc, Dbh, Th, Slc17a6). These cells are located in the Medulla, brain , in or close to the regions: Area postrema . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:4527 NTS Dbh Glut_1." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
